@SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health-Check (US-001)
GET {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Login (US-006) — gültige Zugangsdaten liefern 200 OK mit Token + mustChangePassword-Flag
POST {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

###

### Login (US-006) — falsches Passwort/unbekannte E-Mail liefert 401 mit {"error":"INVALID_CREDENTIALS"}
POST {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "falsches-passwort"
}

###

### Kommunikationsart anlegen (US-037) — Systemadmin-Token in {{adminToken}}, liefert 201 Created
POST {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/communication-types
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Newsletter"
}

###

### Kommunikationsart umbenennen (US-037 Akzeptanzkriterium 2)
PATCH {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/communication-types/{{communicationTypeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Statusbericht"
}

###

### Kommunikationsart deaktivieren (US-037 Akzeptanzkriterium 3) — Datensatz bleibt erhalten
PATCH {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/communication-types/{{communicationTypeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### Kommunikationsarten-Katalog lesen (US-037 Akzeptanzkriterium 4) — nur aktive Einträge, für jeden angemeldeten Nutzer
GET {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/communication-types?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### Kommunikationsarten-Katalog lesen — alle Einträge inkl. deaktivierter (historische Anzeige)
GET {{SlobSteak.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/communication-types
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###
